{
  "id": "892",
  "title": "Cleaning Up",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2020-02-28",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming’s mother tells Little Ming’s father to clean the house.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/892/8c2990c3be35141b80d125556e87c63139e79b1a.mp3?1582277478",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "收拾\n\n小明妈妈：这家里太乱了，你快收拾收拾！\n小明爸爸：等会儿吧，刚吃饱呢。\n小明妈妈：行，你今天收拾好就行。我现在去上班了，等我回家如果你还没把房子收拾好，你就等着被我收拾吧！\n",
    "traditional": "收拾\n\n小明媽媽：這家裡太亂了，你快收拾收拾！\n小明爸爸：等會兒吧，剛吃飽呢。\n小明媽媽：行，你今天收拾好就行。我現在去上班了，等我回家如果你還沒把房子收拾好，你就等著被我收拾吧！\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Cleaning up"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明妈妈：这家里太乱了，你快收拾收拾！",
      "traditional": "小明媽媽：這家裡太亂了，你快收拾收拾！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma zhè jiā lǐ tài luàn le nǐ kuài shōu shi shōu shi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mother: The house is so messy. Clean it up now!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明爸爸：等会儿吧，刚吃饱呢。",
      "traditional": "小明爸爸：等會兒吧，剛吃飽呢。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bà ba děng huì'r ba gāng chī bǎo ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Father: Wait a moment. I’ve just finished eating."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明妈妈：行，你今天收拾好就行。",
      "traditional": "小明媽媽：行，你今天收拾好就行。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma xíng nǐ jīn tiān shōu shi hǎo jiù xíng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我现在去上班了，等我回家如果你还没把房子收拾好，你就等着被我收拾吧！",
      "traditional": "我現在去上班了，等我回家如果你還沒把房子收拾好，你就等著被我收拾吧！",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiàn zài qù shàng bān le děng wǒ huí jiā rú guǒ nǐ hái méi bǎ fáng zi shōu shi hǎo nǐ jiù děng zhe bèi wǒ shōu shi ba",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mother: Okay, just make sure you clean up today."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’m going to work now. If I come back and you still haven’t cleaned the house, you’ll be cleaned up by me!"
    }
  ],
